Architecture: all
Maintainer: FnnDK <fernando.resende.k@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: dkms (>= 2.8)
Recommends: acerctl
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/FnnDK/acerctl
Description: kernel modules of acerctl (DKMS)
 Companion modules of acerctl, next to the in-tree acer_wmi driver:
 acer-wmi-extras (keyboard backlight timeout, USB charging, supported thermal
 profiles, battery sensors) and acer-wmi-battery (80 % charge limit,
 calibration). DKMS rebuilds them for every installed kernel and, with Secure
 Boot, signs them with its own key.
